# Vuka Design System → Tailwind

**Canonical implemented spec:** `docs/vuka-visual-spec.md` (overrides stale `Vuka Design System/` preview HTML where it still shows deep-soil or ember section backgrounds).

Map tokens in `src/styles/global.css` `@theme`:

## Colors (never use raw hex in components)

| Token | Hex | Tailwind key | Use |
|-------|-----|--------------|-----|
| ember | `#C4581C` | `ember` | CTAs, accents, logo mark |
| ember-hover | `#A8490F` | `ember-hover` | Primary button hover |
| parchment | `#F5EFE6` | `parchment` | Default background; text on dark |
| vuka-black | `#1A1008` | `vuka-black` | **Text** — headings, body |
| surface-dark | `#1A1008` | `surface-dark` | **Backgrounds** — footer, dark sections, dark cards |
| baobab | `#8B5A2B` | `baobab` | Muted text, nav links |
| sand | `#D4C4A8` | `sand` | Borders, body on dark |
| rift-green | `#2A4A3A` | `rift-green` | Climate sector tags |

**Do not use:** `deep-soil` (`#3D2B0E`), `bg-deep-soil`, `--color-deep-soil`.

## Surface combinations (`Section.astro`)

| Variant | Classes |
|---------|---------|
| default / parchment | `bg-parchment text-vuka-black` |
| sand | `bg-sand text-vuka-black` |
| dark | `bg-surface-dark text-parchment` |
| bold | `bg-surface-dark text-parchment` (same as dark; use for closing CTA bands) |

Accent on all: `text-ember` / `text-accent`.

**Do not** use `bg-ember` for full-width sections. Ember is for buttons, tags, and small UI accents only.

## Typography

Font: `font-codec` (Codec Pro). Load all weights from `public/fonts/`.

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Display / hero | `font-heavy text-display tracking-tight leading-none` |
| H2 section | `font-heavy text-h2 leading-[0.95] tracking-tight` |
| Body | `font-normal text-lg leading-relaxed` |
| Eyebrow | `font-light text-[11px] uppercase tracking-category text-baobab` |
| On dark sections | headings `text-parchment`, body `text-sand`, eyebrows `inverted` |

Line-height: `leading-relaxed` for body. Headlines: `text-balance`.

## Site chrome

- **Header scrolled:** `background: parchment` — not surface-dark. Logo stays default (dark) SVG.
- **Footer:** `.site-footer` → `#1A1008` / `surface-dark`, `text-parchment`, parchment logo.
- **Mobile nav:** `bg-surface-dark/98`.

## Buttons

- `primary` — ember fill (default CTA on light and dark)
- `secondary` — baobab outline, vuka-black text (no shadow)
- `inverse` — surface-dark fill (rare)

On dark surfaces use `primary`, not parchment inverse buttons.

## Tags

- Sector: `bg-ember text-parchment`
- Climate: `bg-rift-green text-sand`
- Programme / vuka-dark: `bg-surface-dark text-parchment`
- Status: `bg-sand text-baobab`

## Cards

- Light: `vuka-card` — parchment, sand border
- Dark: `vuka-card-dark` — surface-dark bg

Avoid `bg-surface-dark/40` on light backgrounds (reads as old deep-soil brown).

## Spacing (Fibonacci scale)

3, 5, 8, 13, 21, 34, 55, 89, 144px → `vuka-*` spacing tokens.
Section rhythm: `py-16 md:py-24`. Max content: `1200px`, `px-5 md:px-10`.

## Radius & shadow

- Radius: `rounded-sm` (2px) default; `rounded-md` (4px) cards max
- Shadow: sparingly; prefer `border-sand` on cards
- No gradients, no pure white/black

## Motion

`transition-all duration-150 ease-out`. No bounce. `active:scale-[0.97]` on buttons.

## Icons

Stroke icons, 1.5px weight. Logo SVGs from `public/assets/` — never recreate.

## New work checklist

Before shipping UI, verify against `docs/vuka-visual-spec.md` §13.
